<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST -Hungary T-bill yields to fall at auction.</title>
<headline>FORECAST -Hungary T-bill yields to fall at auction.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields on Hungary's discount Treasury bills are likely to drop slightly at this weeks' auctions, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) will auction one-month treasury bills on Tuesday, three-month bills on Wednesday, six-month bills on Thursday and 12-month papers on Friday.</p>
<p>			 1-MONTH    3-MONTH    6-MONTH    12-MONTH</p>
<p>			  HTBM	HTBN	HTBO	 HTBP</p>
<p>Amount on offer</p>
<p>  (bln forints)	1	    5	    14	    14</p>
<p>Previous average</p>
<p>	(pct)	   22.19	22.52	22.62	  22.72</p>
<p>Valid bid range</p>
<p>(pct around</p>
<p>  previous average) +1/-2    +0.5/-2    +0.5/-2	+0.5/-2 @</p>
<p>FORECASTS FROM HUNGARIAN DEALERS:</p>
<p>Gyula Kerdo - Creditanstalt Securities</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	   22.30	22.58	22.65	  22.85</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	   22.18	22.50	22.59	  22.70</p>
<p>Zsolt Bango - Gog Securities</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	   22.33	22.48	22.63	  22.75</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	   22.15	22.39	22.54	  22.66</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
